        `A ${pesoWeaker?'weaker':'stronger'} peso works in two directions at once. Imports and dollar debts cost ${pesoWeaker?'more':'less'}. Exporters and families receiving remittances get ${pesoWeaker?'more':'fewer'} pesos per dollar.`],
       chart:{title:'Pesos per US dollar, daily, one year',stat:fmt(P.value,2),series:[line('MXN per USD',peso.slice(-260),GREEN,v=>fmt(v,2))],yFormat:v=>fmt(v,1),label:'Peso per dollar FIX rate, one year',srcId:'banxico-usdmxn-fix'}},
